---
// The plugin at a glance: an agent's loop on the left, HALO on the right, MCP calls between them.
---

<figure class="halo-figure">
	<svg viewBox="0 0 720 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="arch-title">
		<title id="arch-title">A personal agent logs each step of its loop to the HALO plugin over MCP and asks it for a report.</title>
		<style>
			.box { fill: var(--sl-color-black); stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.1; }
			.inner { fill: var(--halo-panel); stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-4); stroke-width: 0.9; }
			.mod { fill: var(--sl-color-black); stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1; }
			.line { fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.1; }
			.faint { fill: none; stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-4); stroke-width: 0.9; }
			.dash { fill: none; stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
			.t { fill: currentColor; font-family: var(--sl-font); font-size: 12px; }
			.h { fill: currentColor; font-family: var(--halo-display); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
			.s { fill: var(--sl-color-gray-3); font-family: var(--sl-font); font-size: 10.5px; }
			.m { fill: var(--sl-color-gray-2); font-family: var(--sl-font-mono); font-size: 10px; }
			.k { fill: currentColor; font-family: var(--sl-font-mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
		</style>
		<defs>
			<marker id="arr" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
				<path d="M0 0 8 4 0 8z" fill="currentColor" />
			</marker>
			<marker id="arr-g" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
				<path d="M0 0 8 4 0 8z" fill="var(--sl-color-gray-4)" />
			</marker>
		</defs>

		<!-- the agent and its loop -->
		<rect class="box" x="8" y="20" width="236" height="262" rx="10" />
		<text class="h" x="24" y="46">Personal agent</text>
		<text class="s" x="24" y="63">a dot, Grok Bot, Claude Code, your own</text>
		<rect class="mod" x="102" y="96" width="48" height="30" rx="6" />
		<text class="k" x="126" y="115" text-anchor="middle">M</text>
		<rect class="mod" x="36" y="196" width="48" height="30" rx="6" />
		<text class="k" x="60" y="215" text-anchor="middle">S</text>
		<rect class="mod" x="168" y="196" width="48" height="30" rx="6" />
		<text class="k" x="192" y="215" text-anchor="middle">A</text>
		<path class="line" d="M86 211 H164" marker-end="url(#arr)" />
		<path class="line" d="M70 194 L108 130" marker-end="url(#arr)" />
		<path class="line" d="M144 130 L182 194" marker-end="url(#arr)" />
		<path class="faint" d="M188 230 C 150 262, 100 262, 66 232" marker-end="url(#arr-g)" />
		<text class="s" x="126" y="270" text-anchor="middle">six channels between three modules</text>

		<!-- MCP between them -->
		<text class="t" x="356" y="46" text-anchor="middle">MCP</text>
		<text class="s" x="356" y="62" text-anchor="middle">stdio, or HTTPS for hosted agents</text>
		<path class="line" d="M246 116 H466" marker-end="url(#arr)" />
		<text class="t" x="356" y="106" text-anchor="middle">log each step, with the steps it used</text>
		<text class="m" x="356" y="134" text-anchor="middle">observe · remember · recall</text>
		<text class="m" x="356" y="148" text-anchor="middle">act · outcome · revise</text>
		<path class="line" d="M466 212 H246" marker-end="url(#arr)" />
		<text class="t" x="356" y="202" text-anchor="middle">diagnosis on request</text>
		<text class="m" x="356" y="230" text-anchor="middle">halo_report · halo_trace</text>

		<!-- HALO -->
		<rect class="box" x="468" y="20" width="244" height="262" rx="10" />
		<text class="h" x="484" y="46">HALO plugin</text>
		<text class="s" x="484" y="63">on your machine</text>
		<rect class="inner" x="484" y="78" width="212" height="38" rx="6" />
		<text class="t" x="496" y="95">Tools</text>
		<text class="s" x="496" y="109">check each event and its links</text>
		<rect class="inner" x="484" y="128" width="212" height="38" rx="6" />
		<text class="t" x="496" y="145">Ledger</text>
		<text class="s" x="496" y="159">append-only SQLite, one trace per agent</text>
		<rect class="inner" x="484" y="178" width="212" height="38" rx="6" />
		<text class="t" x="496" y="195">Analysis</text>
		<text class="s" x="496" y="209">channels, evidence steps, level</text>
		<rect class="inner" x="484" y="228" width="212" height="38" rx="6" />
		<text class="t" x="496" y="245">Report</text>
		<text class="s" x="496" y="259">the survey's rows, with event ids</text>
		<path class="faint" d="M590 116 V126" marker-end="url(#arr-g)" />
		<path class="faint" d="M590 166 V176" marker-end="url(#arr-g)" />
		<path class="faint" d="M590 216 V226" marker-end="url(#arr-g)" />
	</svg>
	<figcaption>The agent keeps its own loop. HALO only receives the steps the agent logs, keeps them, and reads the loop off their links.</figcaption>
</figure>
